Noncommercial means not primarily intended for commercial advantage or monetary
compensation. A nonprofit label alone does not make a use noncommercial.
Private gameplay with the official launcher is permitted, including an official
edition that offers the licensor's optional support or advertising features.

2. Attribution, original link and changes
Keep this license and copyright notices in all distributed copies. Show
"Based on RE:COPILE by MASELKO-95" and the original repository link in the README
or equivalent documentation and in an accessible About / License view.
For a modified version, identify it as modified and provide a reasonably clear
