Do not claim authorship of the original or endorsement by the original author.

3. Source availability and redistribution
When distributing the software, including a modified version in executable form,
provide the corresponding source and build instructions under these same terms,
either with the copy or through a clearly identified, freely accessible download.
Do not impose terms that remove the permissions granted here for RE:COPILE's
original materials. This condition does not relicense independent third-party
components or restrict the rights granted by their own licenses.

4. Commercial use requires a separate license
This license does not permit commercial use. Before selling, offering paid
